{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>תבחר</b> — with omission of the word אשר, like: לכל יבוא גבורתך, and so it is אשרי, אשר תבחר בו ותקרב שישכן חצריך." "And the sense of נשבעה — delight of the soul in the service of HaShem in the Temple, and he is sated with good, also others with him, in the good of the holy sanctuary of Your temple." "And the sense of בטוב — the glory, which is the holy one." "And some say: בטוב ביתך — You are the holy one in Your sanctuary."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 65, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:42.421762531Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}